{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_04_beg","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_06","title":"遠遁","storyCode":"DM-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2e53565545f7a2f2e209587ed07ef839019d9c9c0253055ff02718a94ef36967","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"我自己明明說過，誰也不能置身事外。\n結果我自己還是想要逃離這場戰爭，因此從巴別塔，從W和殿下那裡......\n逃走了。\n......真是矛盾。\n後悔嗎？也許吧。\n但我就算在那裡，也做不成任何事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:58  A.M.    天氣/小雨\n卡茲戴爾最北部邊郊，戰區邊緣，傭兵營地\n離開巴別塔數月後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"這份情報......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"說點什麼吧，你比較擅長這個，能說會道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......說點什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛把問題拋回來......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......僵持了這麼久的戰局，會在一夜之間傾斜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"這半年多發生了什麼？這太快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道有哪裡出了問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，是哪裡。沒人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該說是不敢知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下......還有殿下身邊的那些人，他們不該淪落到如此下場，我們都這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在......我們的下場呢？也會是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"太早了。這場戰爭結束的太早了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"直到上個月我們都還在履行和巴別塔的戰略合約，聯絡突然中斷，了無音訊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都知道我們是哪一邊的，我們甚至還沒準備好離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果真的就這麼戛然而止，我們只會無處可逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"讓信使再去聯繫一趟在各地的線人，打聽所有能打聽到的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們必須......回到戰場正中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然，我也預料到會有這麼一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我們其實都知道的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們真的想徹底撒手不管，當時就沒必要答應他們的請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"靠我們自己逃離這裡，翻過瓦蘭登湖，在其他地方繼續大展拳腳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我們很難從那裡脫身，那份溫暖太容易令人茫然，我們都沉醉於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們就應該徹底拋下巴別塔，帶著我們的人離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"還是老毛病，你又變得多愁善感起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"從什麼時候開始，我似乎沒有做過任何一個有利於我們的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們已經不該繼續待在戰場上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，你是薩卡茲還是我是薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地還有任何其他哪怕一處避雨的木棚，容納得下我們這些手染鮮血的薩卡茲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"別總是這麼自責，責任是我們共同承擔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，就目前來看，那時候你選擇接納W，還算是個不錯的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她幫我們賺了不少錢，也幹掉了不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......但願吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"W......她還活著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得她沒那麼容易死掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"她在殿下身邊的時日也不短了，說不定她會知道更多的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須迅速把握住現在卡茲戴爾的一切導向，如果能重新找到她，也許事情會變得簡單一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我們真的要依靠她作為後盾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......真遺憾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——找到了，哎，你還真是能跑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你看上去心如死灰，我聽說過你最近在做什麼，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你也應該知道，你是最後一個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，你都看見了，這場仗死了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是在近乎麻木地增加這個數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是從我的立場而言，還沒死掉的任何一個人做的事情，都比你的所作所為更有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"要我提醒你一遍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭已經死了。整個卡茲戴爾，整個泰拉大陸都會知道卡茲戴爾的新王當立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是一次斬首行動，你們依舊保留了很多核心成員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"比如那個指揮官再也沒有出現過，他們做出了正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下沒有徹底趕盡殺絕，是因為他希望儘快終結混亂的局面，卡茲戴爾需要殿下開闢下一段道路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——至於你呢？你是來談論對錯的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不會發問，但你心裡就是這麼想的，一邊這麼想，一邊把當時出現在你視野裡的面孔一個一個抹殺掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底你只是來宣洩個人情緒的，小傭兵，沉浸在自己不值一提的復仇裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你贏不了任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我贏得過你，而且會很輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"殺得掉我，不能說明什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話很多哎，到底是在猜我的心思，還是單純在死之前，發洩你自己的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"都有，我沒必要否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"自從那個凱——自從我差點被同伴噴出的鮮血所窒息之後，我就握不住武器了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都流了血，灑滿巴別塔的殿堂，你眼裡的景象，在我眼裡只會更加真切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你找到了我，那我必死無疑，呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"別扯那麼多，對於殺你這件事......我只是想這麼做而已，就當是排解一下失業的壓力吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呸......我真是低估你了，瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你真能像這樣一點憤怒都沒有地扣下扳機？還是說，你真的瘋到了連自己的情緒都感覺不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你隻身一人......還想繼續這樣追殺多少同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為......你的這種舉動不是在為特雷西斯殿下考慮？你幫他滅口，你還......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不要喋喋不休了，想死的難道不是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你逃回你親愛的攝政王身邊，難道我還真能殺穿卡茲戴爾，把你們一個個揪出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有。你們都沒有。殺了她的你們，不可能再回到卡茲戴爾，再回到你們過去的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那些真正的怪物，沒人還能在看見她的表情後無動於衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們一直等著一個人，等著我這個劊子手，我只是來解脫你而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不收錢就已經很客氣了，知足吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......自以為是的瘋子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但你說的也沒錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們親手染上了她的血......她在最後甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不該稱那個人為“殿下”，殿下只有特蕾西婭。不然你還可以多說幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"篡位者最好不要急著給自己加冕，反正都要掉腦袋的，那樣浪費王冠，等到特蕾西婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拒降者會被其他傭兵追獵的，下一次，你就是獵物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你們早就離開卡茲戴爾境內了......很久不見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......比起這場漫長的戰爭，我們也沒有太長時間不見，你的成長速度還真是驚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是呢，你的手在抖喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有些生疏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有情報指出你在這附近獨自活動——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡離塔巴鎮都有將近兩百公里，你拖著搖搖晃晃的身體想去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還是說你從那之後就這麼一邊獨自行動一邊轉移，持續了數個月——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有很辛苦，就是一個人做很多事情不太方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，你現在一身草草處理的傷勢，隨時有感染加劇的風險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"沒死掉就行，我可沒那麼容易倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是那座塔樓......有點眼熟，這是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡？西部戰區邊緣，座標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊啊，這裡是“W”死的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"也是你加入我們的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":".......這裡已經完全變成廢墟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？想故地重遊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我像是那麼有情調的人嗎？只是最後一個目標逃到這裡來而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們來找我做什麼，像上次一樣，咱們直接開門見山吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......攝政王已經統合了卡茲戴爾的所有武裝力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"殘存的雇傭兵也會被團結起來，組成一支真正的軍隊，然後被遣往大地各處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"真是著急呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"除非維多利亞和拉特蘭的權貴都是些腦子裝滿黃油的廢物，否則沒人會坐視卡茲戴爾在統一後還有喘息的空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那也許我們可以借某些人的手再次挑起內亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你想復仇，這也不是個好選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，現在跟著我們的人有不少都曾和特蕾西婭並肩作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲雇傭兵從來都沒有明確立場。大部分人已經對思考感到麻木，他們只需要一個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"所以全體薩卡茲都會聽命於攝政王，他已經贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——伊內絲，你把你的角打磨成薩卡茲的形狀那時候，疼嗎？會流血嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的這份面目就根本沒有釘入血肉，太膚淺了，繼續裝作一個薩卡茲，你會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你扭曲到讓人咂舌的好意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不想在這個時候，還聽見你自詡“薩卡茲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但我決定要繼續這樣走下去，我只能這樣走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"W，自特蕾西婭殿下失蹤後，卡茲戴爾就已經變了，天翻地覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"大多薩卡茲別無選擇，更何況對很多人而言，這個選擇充滿誘惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，沒來得及徹底脫身的你們，也接受了這個那個兇手的提議？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"否則我們只會是冰涼的屍體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我是說服不了你們放棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不會像赫德雷當時那麼壞心眼，既然都是老相識了......就直接動手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"別總是這麼著急......也許你會對接下來的事情感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們不會回到卡茲戴爾，我們會去烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——這可是個意料之外的答案，早點說啊，我差點就動手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這下有點意思了不是嗎，說說看吧，赫德雷隊長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡茲戴爾之外的大地上，有一些......感染者勢力正在崛起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他們向雇傭兵提出了豐厚的價格，同時攝政王也希望能借此操縱一部分感染者為他的計畫所用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者勢力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們的核心力量，目前尚且停留在烏薩斯的凍土之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"而攝政王的視野也早就離開了這座破敗的卡茲戴爾，王位空置，他早已身在別處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"聚集了各個種族被壓迫、被歧視者的整合運動，正適合擺放在下一個被需要的位置上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"所以加入那個什麼整合運動而遠離卡茲戴爾，不會有人因此起疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後走一步看一步，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我想要的是什麼，我也許也知道你想要什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，這似乎可行性更高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，畢竟我要找的那個人，可是個真正的怪物啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那個老女人也消失了......繼續待在卡茲戴爾的確不妥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......但這一次就不是你們兩個說了算了，我有想做的事情，我要自己決定，沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王會派人來統合這一批傭兵軍隊的，如果只是說我們的小隊之間......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我一向很擅長“應付”上司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......那很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎歸隊，“W”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac9_6"},{"type":"narration","text":"......遠離卡茲戴爾。\nW變了很多，她應該有她自己的想法。\n伊內絲被我推上了這條路，但她比想像中堅強。\n......我呢？\n偶爾可以從一些險峻的地勢眺望到煙霧籠罩中的卡茲戴爾。\n卡茲戴爾。\n我也許，才是那個最想逃離卡茲戴爾的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
